1
00:00:00,367 --> 00:00:02,447
(Sheldon:)...nor the ability to use umbrellas.

2
00:00:02,619 --> 00:00:04,869
(Penny:)Oh, my God.
I gotta go to the emergency room.

3
00:00:05,038 --> 00:00:07,168
(Sheldon:)Assuming you're correct
that your humerus...

4
00:00:07,332 --> 00:00:10,542
(Sheldon:)...is no longer seated
in the glenoid socket, I would think so.

5
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:12,380
(Penny:)-Can you drive me?
-I don't drive.

6
00:00:12,545 --> 00:00:14,085
(Penny:)Well, I can't drive.

7
00:00:14,631 --> 00:00:16,971
(Sheldon:)Well, it seems we've reached an impasse.

8
00:00:17,133 --> 00:00:18,263
Ow!

9
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:21,093
(Sheldon:)I could call you a cab or an ambulance.

10
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:24,263
(Penny:)No, no, no, I can't wait that long.
You gotta help me. Please?

11
00:00:24,432 --> 00:00:27,222
(Sheldon:)All right. Let it never be said
that Sheldon Lee Cooper...

12
00:00:27,394 --> 00:00:29,684
(Sheldon:)...ignored the pleas
of a damsel in distress.

13
00:00:29,854 --> 00:00:31,524
(Penny:)No one's saying that. Let's go.

14
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:35,280
(Sheldon:)It does seem rather ironic that
for want of 99-cent adhesive ducks...

15
00:00:35,443 --> 00:00:38,533
(Sheldon:)...we both might die in a fiery car crash.

16
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:42,990
(Leonard:)I wish Penny didn't have to work.
She loves camping.

17
00:00:43,159 --> 00:00:46,159
That would've been great.
You and Penny having sex in the tent...

18
00:00:46,329 --> 00:00:49,579
(Raj:)...while I sit out here
and watch Howard hump a cactus.

19
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:54,920
(Howard:)Okay, the best I can tell,
there are eight other campsites nearby.

20
00:00:55,088 --> 00:00:59,018
(Howard:)Mostly science nerds like us,
but just over yon ridge...

